{"id":"chokes-pattern-testing-and-care","rev":1,"lang":"pt","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Teste de chumbada e cuidados com os chokes","summary":"Como verificar a sua pattern (chumbada) numa placa, como limpar e lubrificar os chokes, e porque é que os atiradores de Sporting™ e Compak® Sporting não disparam uma arma de multichoke (chokes intermutáveis) sem um choke colocado.","body":[{"k":"chokes-pattern-testing-and-care-p1","t":"p","html":"Para ver o que o seu choke realmente faz, atira para uma <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pt/glossary/pattern-plate/\"><span lang=\"en\">pattern plate</span> (placa de chumbada)</a>: uma grande chapa de aço pintada ou engraxada para os grãos deixarem marcas. Uma grande folha de papel, de cerca de 1 × 1 m, também serve. Faça isto só num campo que tenha uma placa dessas, e com a autorização do pessoal.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"chokes-pattern-testing-and-care-p2","t":"p","html":"Para verificar a <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pt/glossary/gun-fit/\"><span lang=\"en\">gun fit</span> (adaptação da coronha)</a> atira-se a curta distância, cerca de 15 m (16 yards): o que importa aí é onde fica o centro da <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pt/glossary/pattern/\"><span lang=\"en\">pattern</span> (chumbada)</a>. Para avaliar o choke em si a distância é maior, classicamente 35 m ou 40 jardas (cerca de 36,6 m). No papel desenha-se um círculo com 75–76 cm de diâmetro em torno da parte mais densa, e contam-se os furos dos grãos dentro dele. Depois compara-se esse número com o número de grãos no cartucho (cerca de 350–400 para 28 g de n.º 7½; ver <a href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/pt/learn/cartridges-shot-size/\">Número do chumbo</a>).","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"dg-pattern-sheet","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-pattern-sheet\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-pattern-sheet\">Verificar a chumbada numa folha</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"30 30 640 280\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-pattern-sheet\" focusable=\"false\"><circle class=\"dg-man\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\"/><path class=\"dg-dist\" d=\"M74 170H176\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"180\" y=\"60\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\" rx=\"2\"/>\n<circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"300.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"272.7\" cy=\"183.8\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"305.0\" cy=\"106.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"344.7\" cy=\"215.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"213.3\" cy=\"145.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"317.8\" cy=\"149.3\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"288.1\" cy=\"202.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"270.5\" cy=\"106.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"374.8\" cy=\"185.9\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"213.6\" cy=\"193.9\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"313.8\" cy=\"132.1\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"316.1\" cy=\"208.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"238.9\" cy=\"126.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"383.4\" cy=\"142.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"291.8\" cy=\"171.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"294.6\" cy=\"120.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"346.5\" cy=\"197.3\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"223.2\" cy=\"163.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"364.5\" cy=\"99.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"298.7\" cy=\"186.1\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"267.9\" cy=\"123.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"367.0\" cy=\"168.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"232.1\" cy=\"204.9\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"300.9\" cy=\"156.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"318.7\" cy=\"191.0\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"245.2\" cy=\"143.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"367.1\" cy=\"130.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"265.9\" cy=\"237.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"292.6\" cy=\"140.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"341.0\" cy=\"180.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"237.6\" cy=\"175.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"343.3\" cy=\"96.1\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"315.9\" cy=\"247.9\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"273.8\" cy=\"140.7\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"354.0\" cy=\"155.7\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"251.8\" cy=\"209.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"300.4\" cy=\"78.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"310.3\" cy=\"170.8\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"257.8\" cy=\"156.3\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"348.8\" cy=\"124.8\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"286.2\" cy=\"232.2\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"251.3\" cy=\"86.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"327.2\" cy=\"167.1\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"255.0\" cy=\"181.9\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"323.6\" cy=\"99.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"331.4\" cy=\"233.1\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"294.6\" cy=\"157.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"336.6\" cy=\"149.3\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"270.7\" cy=\"207.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"284.4\" cy=\"90.9\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"372.4\" cy=\"208.8\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"277.4\" cy=\"162.7\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"330.4\" cy=\"126.1\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"302.4\" cy=\"221.7\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"243.6\" cy=\"105.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"394.1\" cy=\"164.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"273.9\" cy=\"180.5\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle class=\"dg-hole\" cx=\"307.5\" cy=\"108.6\" r